---
const title = "RTFP — coming soon";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif;
        background: #fafaf9;
        color: #1c1917;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 2rem;
      }
      main {
        max-width: 36rem;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3rem);
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #57534e;
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
      }
      .small {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #78716c;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>RTFP</h1>
      <p>
        A cross-platform comparison of the major social platforms' transparency
        reports under the EU Digital Services Act.
      </p>
      <p>
        Site coming in June 2026. The underlying database is already
        live and publicly queryable.
      </p>
      <p class="small">
        Built from the H2 2025 harmonised filings of TikTok, Instagram,
        LinkedIn, and X.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>